WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:24.504
Gasser was sad.

2
00:00:24.505 --> 00:00:27.865
"Don't be sad," Poppy said.

3
00:00:27.866 --> 00:00:37.018
"We can fix everything," Dipper said.

4
00:00:37.019 --> 00:00:47.835
"I'll help," Carlin said.

5
00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:52.201
"Jeb, I have an idea," Eddy said.

6
00:00:52.202 --> 00:00:56.326
"Follow me."

7
00:00:56.327 --> 00:01:00.085
Eddy and Jeb went to the dirt pile.

8
00:01:00.086 --> 00:01:02.798
Everyone else got to work.

9
00:01:02.799 --> 00:01:08.547
Dipper planted new flowers.

10
00:01:08.548 --> 00:01:13.488
Carlin fixed the sign.

11
00:01:13.489 --> 00:01:17.997
Gasser stood the fountain back up.

12
00:01:17.998 --> 00:01:24.847
Poppy cleaned up the broken statue.

13
00:01:24.848 --> 00:01:33.097
Soon the garden looked nice again.

14
00:01:33.098 --> 00:01:36.569
Gasser smiled.

15
00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.538
Eddy came back.

16
00:01:39.539 --> 00:01:42.237
"Hey, everyone," he said.

17
00:01:42.238 --> 00:01:46.375
"Jeb and I have a surprise!"

18
00:01:46.376 --> 00:01:51.440
Eddy led everyone to the dirt.

19
00:01:51.441 --> 00:01:53.816
The pile was gone.

20
00:01:53.817 --> 00:01:57.429
Now there was a dirt track.

21
00:01:57.430 --> 00:02:00.822
"That looks fun!" Carlin said.

22
00:02:00.823 --> 00:02:07.416
"It sure does!" Grandma said.

23
00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:27.822
Everyone drove on the track.

24
00:02:27.823 --> 00:02:30.671
Grandma jumped a ramp.

25
00:02:30.672 --> 00:02:33.882
"Whee!"
